<</Type/StructElem/S/P/P 81 0 R /E(JAMZA! 2025 achieved its vision of creating a festive, all-female music showcase that brought together artists, creatives, and audience members for a shared celebration of music and the Christmas season. The event provided a meaningful platform for female performers and designers to collaborate, express their creativity, and connect with a live audience. Beyond the performances, JAMZA! created opportunities for interaction and community, making the experience more engaging for everyone involved. )/Pg 20 0 R /K[ 0]>>
